<section id="S3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.2 </span>SwissAI FineWeb-edu-score 2 dataset</h3>

<div id="S3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We index all of the SwissAI Fineweb-edu-score 2 dataset. The dataset has undergone some filtering process, and is composed of 95 MAIN-CC dumps. As illustrated with the previous SwissAI FineWeb-2 dataset, we perform parallel processing of the 95 dumps simultaenously, which render 95 source indexes. For these indexes, at the time of writing of the raport, subsequent merge stages to obtain a unique final index are still ongoing. We randomly sample 3 source indexes among these 95 to perform search queries upon WeaponizedWords (visible in Table <a href="#S3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 3.2 SwissAI FineWeb-edu-score 2 dataset ‣ 3 Search results on SwissAI training data ‣ Going over Fine Web with a Fine-Tooth Comb:Technical Report of Indexing Fine Web for Problematic Content Search and Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>), a list of Obscene Words <span id="footnote4" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">4</span>
              
              
              
            <a href="https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/LDNOOBW/List-of-Dirty-Naughty-Obscene-and-Otherwise-Bad-Words</a></span></span></span>, and a Chat-GPT generated list of misinformation keywords (see Table <a href="#S3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 3.2 SwissAI FineWeb-edu-score 2 dataset ‣ 3 Search results on SwissAI training data ‣ Going over Fine Web with a Fine-Tooth Comb:Technical Report of Indexing Fine Web for Problematic Content Search and Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>)</p>
</div>
