<span id="S3.T6.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T6.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Japanese Data Show Vaccines Cause Autism June 3, 2009 Just months following the US Court of Federal Claims rejection of the claim that the MMR vaccine causes autism, here you will see data from formal peer refereed medical papers showing that vaccines caused autism in Japanese children and will be doing (<a href="http://recoveringnicholas.com/2010/02/13/japanese-data-show-vaccines-cause-autism/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">http://recoveringnicholas.com/2010/02/13/japanese-data-show-vaccines-cause-autism/</a>)</span>
</span></td></tr>
