</span></td>
<td id="S3.T6.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T6.2.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T6.2.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Does Thimerosal used in vaccines cause Autism? 2. Does the MMR vaccine cause autism? 3. | Does the combination of Thimerosal-containing vaccines and the MMR vaccine cause autism? (<a href="http://spiriteddoula.blogspot.com/2009/02/vaccine-court-to-release-autism-ruling.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">http://spiriteddoula.blogspot.com/2009/02/vaccine-court-to-release-autism-ruling.html</a>)</span>
</span></td></tr>
