<span id="S3.T6.2.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">22.754</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T6.2.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T6.2.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:341.4pt;">
<span id="S3.T6.2.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Do Vaccines Cause Autism? Our crack team of scienticians have investigated. Read on for the full report. Q: Do vaccines cause autism? A: No. (<a href="http://blog.westandfirm.org/2008/06/change-of-pace.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">http://blog.westandfirm.org/2008/06/change-of-pace.html</a>)</span>
</span></td></tr>
