<span id="S3.T7.2.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T7.2.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">25.143</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T7.2.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:-1pt;padding-bottom:-1pt;">
<span id="S3.T7.2.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T7.2.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Transtrend aims to contribute to well-functioning, well-organized and reliable markets. Transtrend – and its clients – must therefore be prepared to take risks. Transtrend aims to promote a healthy balance between supply and demand. (<a href="https://www.transtrend.com/en/approach/responsible-investing/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.transtrend.com/en/approach/responsible-investing/</a>)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T7.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
