<span id="S3.T7.2.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">A "transtrender" refers to a person who identifies as transgender because they think it’s cool to do so. There’s a lot of problematic implications that go with the term "transtrender." "Transtrender" is a word no person in this community should ever use or condone. (<a href="https://letsqueerthingsup.com/2015/03/28/why-the-trans-community-needs-to-ban-the-word-transtrender-for-good/?like_comment=2496&amp;_wpnonce=108d059f06" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://letsqueerthingsup.com/2015/03/28/why-the-trans-community-needs-to-ban-the-word-transtrender-for-good/?like_comment=2496&amp;_wpnonce=108d059f06</a>)</span>
